ObserverTest
├── startObserver
│   ├── given a document with a body
│   │   ├── it watches the body
│   │   └── it watches shadow roots separately
│   ├── given no body
│   │   └── it does not start
│   └── given it is already running
│       └── it keeps the same observer and takes the new config
├── isOwnWrite
│   ├── given an element inside our span
│   │   └── it is ours
│   ├── given a text node inside our span
│   │   └── it is ours
│   ├── given an element the page owns
│   │   └── it is not ours
│   └── given a node with no parent element
│       └── it is not ours
├── isStillInPage
│   ├── given a node in the document
│   │   └── it is in the page
│   ├── given a node removed from the document
│   │   └── it is not in the page
│   ├── given a node inside a live shadow tree
│   │   └── it is in the page
│   ├── given a node inside a detached shadow tree
│   │   └── it is not in the page
│   └── given a node in a fragment
│       └── it is not in the page
├── reacting to mutations
│   ├── given an element is added
│   │   └── it converts prices inside it
│   ├── given the added element is our own output
│   │   └── it is ignored
│   ├── given text is added inside a converted element
│   │   ├── it reverts the stale conversion
│   │   └── it converts the new text
│   ├── given text is added outside any conversion
│   │   └── it converts the parent
│   ├── given text is added inside our own span
│   │   └── it is ignored
│   ├── given text changes in a converted element
│   │   ├── it reverts the stale conversion
│   │   └── it converts the new text
│   ├── given text changes beside a converted price
│   │   └── it reverts and re-converts the whole element
│   ├── given text changes outside any conversion
│   │   └── it converts the element
│   ├── given text changes inside our own span
│   │   └── it is ignored
│   └── given a shadow root appears with new content
│       ├── it is observed too
│       └── given the same root is probed again
│           └── it is not observed twice
├── given the observer was never started
│   └── it does nothing
├── batching
│   ├── given several roots in one batch
│   │   └── it converts once per frame
│   ├── given one queued root contains another
│   │   └── it skips the one already covered
│   ├── given a root left the page before the flush
│   │   └── it is not converted
│   ├── given a root inside a shadow tree
│   │   └── it is still considered part of the page
│   ├── given the document is never rendered
│   │   └── it flushes on a timer instead
│   └── given an infinite-scroll page queues past the cap
│       └── it falls back to rescanning the body once
├── SPA route changes
│   ├── given the page pushes a new route
│   │   ├── it drops stale markers
│   │   └── it converts the new content
│   ├── given the page replaces the route
│   │   └── it does the same
│   └── given the user goes back
│       └── it does the same
├── after stopping
│   ├── given records are replayed anyway
│   │   └── it does nothing
│   └── given a route change fires anyway
│       └── it does nothing
├── stopObserver
│   ├── it disconnects the observer
│   ├── it restores the history methods it patched
│   └── it drops any queued work
└── updateObserverConfig
    ├── given the observer is running
    │   ├── it swaps the rates without tearing the observer down
    │   └── it converts at the new rate
    └── given the observer is not running
        └── it starts one
